      "side": 1,
      "message": "+ Jeff as well.\n\nIt is not possible to cover the edge cases in unit test. So I created a manual regression test (go/carrier-serivce-binding-test) to make sure in all scenarios below there should be one (and at most one) persistent binding from phone to Carrier Service:\n- Tycho in \"normal\" status\n- Tycho crash once\n- Tycho has repeated crashes\n\nHopefully we can turn those test cases into automatic test later. This will give us more confidence on the persist binding behavior in platform side.",
      "revId": "af1b413e275489bbb461af8f0935ec541d29a73b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
